To fix this, you can use the `after` method in Tkinter to periodically check the elapsed time and call `end_game` when the time is up. Here is how you can modify the `start_game` method to include this periodic check:

```python
def start_game(self):
    self.timer.start()
    self.current_word = self.word_manager.get_random_word()
    self.word_label.config(text=self.current_word)
